        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-11T17:06:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To go one step further, if your flag can change the underlying behavior of everything, but there are no specific test here, you can write a parametric tests to run all test with the flag on and with the flag off.\n\nsee example of the first parametric test in bluetooth here: aosp/3107395, or another usage here: aosp/3063415\n\nBut if you can, I would really love to see a negative test that shows that your CL is indeed addressing the issue it is suppose to (FYI I am writing that before looking at the CL at all, so sorry if no such thing apply here  😂)",
      "parentUuid": "99eadd48_cfd1be35",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 251,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 251,
        "endChar": 72
      },
      "revId": "83aa59968e4f5fb789fcc1da5d9075691a352082",
